G3128.def:
**Μανασσῆς**, -ῆ, ὁ (Heb. מְנַשֶּׁה),
**Manasseh**;
1. (a) the first-born son of Joseph;
(b) **the tribe which bore his name**: [[Rev.7.6|Rev.7:6]]
2. **King of Judah**: [[Mat.1.10|Mat.1:10]]†
(AS)

G3195.def:
**μέλλω**,
[in LXX: [[Job.3.8|Job.3:8]] (עָתִיד) 19:25 (אַחֲרוֹן); elsewhere for fut., and frequently in Wi, II, 4Mac ;]
**to be about** to be or do;
1. with inf. (Bl., §62, 4; 68, 2; M, _Pr._, 114);
(a) of intending or being about to do of one's own free will: with inf. praes., [[Mat.2.13|Mat.2:13]], [[Luk.10.1|Luk.10:1]], [[Act.3.3; 5.35|Act.3:3 5:35]], [[Heb.8.5|Heb.8:5]], [[2Pe.1.12|2Pe.1:12]] (Field, _Notes_, 240), al.; with inf. aor. (Bl., §58, 3), [[Act.12.6|Act.12:6]], [[Rev.3.16|Rev.3:16]];
(b) **of compulsion, necessity or certainty**: with inf. praes., [[Mat.16.27|Mat.16:27]], [[Luk.9.31|Luk.9:31]], [[Jhn.6.71|Jhn.6:71]], [[Rom.4.24|Rom.4:24]], al.; with inf. aor., [[Rom.8.18|Rom.8:18]], [[Gal.3.23|Gal.3:23]], [[Rev.3.2; 12.4|Rev.3:2 12:4]].
2. Ptcp., ὁ μέλλων: absol., [[Rom.8.38|Rom.8:38]], [[1Co.3.22|1Co.3:22]]; τὰ μ., [[Col.2.17|Col.2:17]] εἰς τὸ μ. (Field, _Notes_, 65); with subst., [[Mat.3.7; 12.32|Mat.3:7 12:32]] (ὁ αἰὼν ὁ μ.; LXX for עַד), [[Act.24.25|Act.24:25]], [[1Ti.4.8|1Ti.4:8]], [[Heb.2.5|Heb.2:5]], al.
(AS)

G3120.def:
**μαλακός**, -ή, -όν
[in LXX: [[Pro.25.15|Pro.25:15]] (רַךְ) [[Pro.26.22|Pro.26:22]] (לָהַם)* ;]
**soft**;
1. prop., **to the touch **(opposite to σκληρός): of clothing, pl., [[Mat.11.8|Mat.11:8]], [[Luk.7.25|Luk.7:25]].
2. **Of persons and their mode of living**;
(a) **mild, gentle**;
(b) **soft, effeminate**: [[1Co.6.9|1Co.6:9]] (prob. in obscene sense, cf. Deiss., _LAE_, 150, 4; MM, xvi; Zorell, see word).†
(AS)
